{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然距離休業式沒剩幾天，不過考試已經結束，等著寒假到來的學生們其實還挺有空閒時間的──", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學～我向社團的大家收集了連署喔～」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "jc0046", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的？我記得妳是啦啦隊社的。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3188", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然還是會想幫男生的棒球社和足球社的比賽加油嘛，欸嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "jc0047", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生～這疊紙本搬去印刷室就好了嗎？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 310, "voice": "db0026", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……對，麻煩你了！我把現在手上的份裝訂好之後也會過去！」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，１年級幫忙的學生。」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": "sk0642", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟預想的一樣，確定好升學目標的學生大家都挺有空的呢～」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": "mu0305", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我回來了～哼哼哼嗯，看啊這麼多的連署……不愧是我。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "sn0207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "收集連署比預料中的更順利。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然我跟愛理忙到昏天暗地，但這也是快樂的負擔。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老實說，我以為會很難從沒有體驗過男女合班的人那邊收集到連署……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3189", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「或許昨天班上同學的那種忌妒，全校的學生都有同樣想法？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、啊……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3190", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我們、在別人面前有那麼明顯嗎……？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3191", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是不是不是，我不是指那個，而是T班男女生都有讓她們很羨慕之類的。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說……說的也是，我們沒有那麼高調對吧。」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3192", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，不要嚇我啦……我還以為是不是接吻被看到了……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3193", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吶吶，聽說瀨名同學他們在校內接吻了喔～」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "sb0041", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！！？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3194", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不要說出去！拜託不要再散播出去了～！」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3195", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君……你的女朋友真的傻傻的欸～」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "da0038", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊真的很抱歉，拜託饒了我們吧！」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「兩個人的臉都好紅～」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "sb0042", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新……新吾這個笨蛋！」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3196", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、我嗎！？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都是新吾把話題帶到奇怪的方向……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3197", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「第二回合要開始了是吧喂！」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "sn0208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……不、不是的，大家、不是那樣的！」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3198", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感謝招待！」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "sb0043", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3199", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "話說回來，如果大家是因為羨慕的話，那我跟愛理也不能沒有行動。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請慢走～請慢走～離開前～」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請幫我們連署！」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3200", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是給為了正式合併而努力的學園長的加油連署！」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟放學後站在校門口送大家離開的安潔一起，我們積極地收集連署。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「此時此刻蘭華小姐不在校內，現在是絕佳機會喔，唔呼呼～」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳，安潔。有引人注目的安潔幫我們一起喊，真的幫了很大的忙。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3201", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼～不愧是安潔呢！」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且新吾同學、愛理同學。像這樣站在校門口，有沒有發現什麼事呢？」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0600", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……什麼事？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所有學生們比起１０月剛開始的時候，都變帥、變可愛了呢～安潔是這麼覺得的。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0601", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……啊……嗯，這樣一說的確……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3202", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為有我們各務台的男生在，結女的學生們都開始注重了起來。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "反過來說，因為同學們是大小姐──各務台的人也不會讓自己鬆懈下來。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想起以前學園長在全校集會上說過的話。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……果然，女性就是要有男性、男性要有女性的視線才行嗎？」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈哈，好像是那樣呢～愛理同學♪真的變漂亮了～」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0602", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什……別、別這樣啦……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3203", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該說，愛理從以前就很可愛。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇～新吾同學的放閃力實在太驚人了！！」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0603", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3204", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理同學都說不出話來了。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "ag0604", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "始終很生澀的部分也很可愛啊，這句話就別說出來了吧。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總之，收集連署進行得很順利──", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該怎麼說呢……只有這樣是不是不夠……？」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "離開了校門口，我們來到學生食堂喝飲料休息。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此時，我突然想到這個問題。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也有同樣的感覺。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3205", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理露出了煩惱的表情。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，身為學生要做到比這更多的事情……如果變成募款的話實在有點那個。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3206", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是不是，我不是那個意思，是指對學園長來說。」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3207", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「連署的數量的確是一股支持的力量，但是該怎麼說呢……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我漸漸在腦中整理出思緒。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連署的數量的確是一股力量，可是再怎麼說都只是數字……", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳想想，學園長是個在全校集會的時候，總是看著全部學生的臉說話的人對吧？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊！」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3208", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不必詳細說明就理解，愛理的眼神閃閃發光。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，這個「不必詳細說明就理解」的默契讓我們都笑了。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對吧？」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……說的對，也想要做到那樣呢。」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3210", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這也是從愛理提出的收集連署支持學園長的大方向聯想到的。」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我們，好像是兩個人在思考一樣呢。」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3211", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不知不覺中就變成這樣了。」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們又對彼此微笑。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "手伸向對方，指尖交纏。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是我，新吾是新吾……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3212", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女生和男生。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……但是。」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3213", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大小不同的手與手交握在一起。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「『我們』……對吧。」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3214", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的溫度和愛理的溫度傳達給對方。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "成為分不出是誰的體溫，但又同時是兩人的體溫。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯！走吧新吾。還有很多同學還在學校呢！」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": "ar3215", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好！」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
